  "headline": "Aprepitant is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a plant classified OAI 158 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E8", "E5", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows aprepitant is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for the 80 mg capsule (NDC 51407070202) names Pharmathen International S. A. as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3009961173).",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1292960 classified that plant OAI with an end date of 2025-11-21 and a known date of 2026-02-26.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An import alert (66-40) for the same firm was published on 2026-04-23, and a warning letter was issued on 2026-05-27.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification occurred 158 days before the import alert posting.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 71 capsules at 8.4 per day (8.4 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 239 capsules at 9.1 per day (26.4 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked transfer option moves 47 capsules from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving the sender with 21 days and bringing the receiver to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
